# AIT with a fiducial-point offset: PV1_0 = 1, PV1_1 = phi_0 = 20,
# PV1_2 = theta_0 = 10 (Paper II sect. 2.5). Unlike CAR (pvlon_car_offset,
# translation-invariant in phi), AIT is not, so phi_0 changes the answer:
# ignoring PV1_1 gives a 1.55e4 arcsec error. Synthetic.
NOTE pipeline: PVi_0..2 offset on a non-cylindrical projection (phi_0 matters)
GRID 1 360 9 1 180 9
PIX 180.5 90.5
HEADER
NAXIS   = 2
NAXIS1  = 360
NAXIS2  = 180
CTYPE1  = 'RA---AIT'
CTYPE2  = 'DEC--AIT'
CRVAL1  = 40.0
CRVAL2  = 25.0
CRPIX1  = 180.5
CRPIX2  = 90.5
CDELT1  = -0.5
CDELT2  = 0.5
PV1_0   = 1.0
PV1_1   = 20.0
PV1_2   = 10.0
